OL,3,ANew Zealand PM says election 'too close
OL,4,Ato call' with result yet to be declared
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew Zealand PM Christopher Luxon says
OL,7,Fthe election is "too close to call" -
OL,8,Fhow does NZ's mixed member proportional
OL,9,Fvoting system work?
OL,11,FLuxon, who leads the centre-right
OL,12,FNational Party, tells supporters the
OL,13,F"final shape of government" won't be
OL,14,Fclear until later this month - here's
OL,15,Fwhy there's a wait
OL,17,FEarlier, Luxon's main opponent,
OL,18,FLabour's Chris Hipkins, said the people
OL,19,Fof New Zealand had spoken - but "it may
OL,20,Ftake a bit longer to work out what
OL,21,Fthey've said"
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
